      "nameZh": "中博面上、特别与国自然不是一概互斥",
      "nameEn": "Postdoctoral grants and NSFC are not universally exclusive",
      "ruleZh": "2026特别资助把已获中博面上或国自然列为优先推荐条件；但项目内容、同站获奖和其他经费限制仍须分别满足，不应把所有金额直接累加。",
      "ruleEn": "Prior General postdoctoral or NSFC awards can support a Special Programme nomination in 2026; content, same-station award and financial rules still apply independently.",
